---
// Philosophy.astro
---
<section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
    <span class="badge">Our Philosophy</span>
    <h2 class="section-title mt-2">Standardize what matters. Innovate where it creates value.</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-600 text-left md:text-center">
      <p>We believe modern industrial systems should be built on a strong foundation of quality, reliability, maintainability, and standardization.</p>
      <p>By combining Industry 4.0 principles, AI-driven technologies, global manufacturing resources, and Canadian integration standards, we build scalable automation platforms designed for long-term operational success.</p>
      <p class="font-medium text-industrial-700">Innovation should not exist for complexity alone. It should create measurable value through:</p>
      <ul class="list-none space-y-2 text-left md:text-center">
        <li>🔹 improved quality</li>
        <li>🔹 operational efficiency</li>
        <li>🔹 data visibility</li>
        <li>🔹 predictive capability</li>
        <li>🔹 long-term scalability</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="font-semibold text-industrial-900">We are not simply supplying machines.<br/>We build intelligent industrial systems designed for the future of manufacturing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>